  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Protoceratops andrewsi has a short parrotlike beak, broad skin-covered frill and low four-legged body without long facial horns. Soft tissues, colours and dimensions are estimated; skeletal frill openings do not imply holes through living skin.",
    "zh": "安氏原角龙 Protoceratops andrewsi 具有短鹦鹉状喙、覆皮宽颈盾和低矮四足身体，没有长面角。软组织、颜色与尺寸为估计；骨质颈盾的孔洞不意味着活体皮肤也有贯通孔洞。"
  },
